     <h1 class="title" title="Umrangshu Hill Station">Umrangshu</h1>
     <div class="entry-content">
<p><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/INDIAHILLSTATION.INFO/images/east-india-hill-stations/umrangshu-hill-station.jpg" title="Umrangshu hill station" alt="Umrangshu hill station, hill stations in india, east india hill stations, Umrangshu" style="width:200px;height:150px" class="thumb alignright"/>


<b>Location:</b> Assam<br />
<b>Area:</b> 417.5 sq.Kms<br />
<b>Significance:</b> Hill Station<br />
<b>Altitude:</b> 680m above sea level<br />
<b>Best time to visit:</b> November to March</p>     
<p><b>Main Attractions:</b> Mountains, Natural beauty</p>
<p><b>Umrangshu</b> lies on the <b>border of Assam</b> and Meghalaya, 112 km from Haflong. This hill station is blessed with natural area cacher background North Hills. Simplicity's sake, to enjoy this magical journey, should go to Haflong Umrangshu Hill and through the <b>JOWA</b> and <b>Shillong Hill</b>.</p>






